    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d243">

                <pb facs="0669" n="619" xml:id="pg619"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">Paris Peace Conf. 184.011102/203: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Commission to Negotiate
                            Peace to Mr. Albert
                    Halstead</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Paris</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1919-07-26T18:00:00+01:00">July 26, 1919—6
                    p.m.</date></dateline></opener>
                <p>141. Your telegrams 646, 647, 654.<anchor n="83" xml:id="d243-f1"/> Commission
                    does not wish you to carry on any negotiations with Boehm. You should have
                    nothing whatsoever to do with the matter directly or indirectly.</p>
                <closer><hi rendition="#small-caps">Am</hi>[<hi rendition="#small-caps">erican</hi>]
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Mission</hi></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
